      "text": "that in the circumstances  stated in the affidavit filed along with the WP(C) the High Court be  pleased to direct the respondents to pay immediately the balance  compensation and other benefits due to the peitioners, in the matter of  widening of vengoor - Nayathode Road (Airport road), in terms of the  provisions of the right to Fair compensation and Transparency in LAnd  Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Re-settlement Act, 2013 pending disposal  of the Writ Petition.\n This petition coming on for admission upon perusing the petition and  the affidavit filed in support of WP(C) and upon hearing the arguments of  SRI.WILSON URMESE Advocates for the petitioners and of GOVERNMENT PLEADER  for respondents, the court passed the following:\n WP(C) No.32456/2023 4/5  MURALI PURUSHOTHAMAN, J.\n ---------------------------------------------\n W.P.(C) No.32456 of 2023  -------------------------------------------------\n Dated this the 16th day of October, 2023  ORDER Fr. Thomas Mangalassery vs The District Collector on 16 October, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/5298876/\n3 Admit.\nThe learned Government Pleader takes notice for the respondents.",
